<p>It's great to see you here and spend time with you on the internet. I look forward to having you back!</p>
<p>Wishing you the best,</p>
<p>{{ my_username }}</p>
{% autoescape off %}
<img style="width: 60%; max-width: 300px;" src="{{ photo }}" alt="A photo of me from {{ site_name }}"></img>
{% endautoescape %}
